WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.417
- I'm just being jabbed, constantly.

00:00:04.130 --> 00:00:05.178
- Yeah.

00:00:05.178 --> 00:00:07.761
(lively music)

00:00:13.666 --> 00:00:15.856
- You didn't play with needles as a kid?

00:00:15.856 --> 00:00:16.907
(laughs)

00:00:16.907 --> 00:00:18.039
- Who am I with?!

00:00:18.039 --> 00:00:20.600
There is a difference between hand-poking

00:00:20.600 --> 00:00:21.901
and hand-tapping, I think.

00:00:21.901 --> 00:00:22.951
Definitely, watched Rihanna get it,

00:00:22.951 --> 00:00:25.748
and it was kind of freaky, she
looks like she was in pain.

00:00:25.748 --> 00:00:26.772
- I've never seen it done.

00:00:26.772 --> 00:00:27.945
- So, this kind of freaks me out too.

00:00:27.945 --> 00:00:29.228
I'm thinking like it's gonna be like

00:00:29.228 --> 00:00:31.675
a gigantically long needle.

00:00:31.675 --> 00:00:32.532
I'm freaking out.

00:00:32.532 --> 00:00:36.336
- I mean, I imagine it's actually
like a piercing, but like.

00:00:36.336 --> 00:00:37.594
- [Both] Like multiple times

00:00:37.594 --> 00:00:39.584
What are you looking forward to most?

00:00:39.584 --> 00:00:41.993
- I'm excited to have
something on my sternum.

00:00:41.993 --> 00:00:44.576
(lively music)

00:00:46.784 --> 00:00:50.488
- My name is Rachel
Finelli, and I'm a tattooer.

00:00:50.488 --> 00:00:52.633
I do both machine and hand-poke work,

00:00:52.633 --> 00:00:54.230
and I work out of my house.

00:00:54.230 --> 00:00:55.370
- W.T.F. Hand-poking?

00:00:55.370 --> 00:00:57.830
- Hand-poking is exactly
what it sounds like.

00:00:57.830 --> 00:00:59.978
I strap a needle to a piece of wood,

00:00:59.978 --> 00:01:04.554
and poke you manually, Over
and over and over again.

00:01:04.554 --> 00:01:06.338
- How deep do you?

00:01:06.338 --> 00:01:08.464
- It's not deep, it's
not as deep as a shot.

00:01:08.464 --> 00:01:12.107
It's kind of like, paper cut level.

00:01:12.107 --> 00:01:13.920
- I hate paper cuts.

00:01:13.920 --> 00:01:15.489
- I hate getting tattooed,

00:01:15.489 --> 00:01:16.499
(all laugh)

00:01:16.499 --> 00:01:18.325
it's not as bad as you would expect it.

00:01:18.325 --> 00:01:20.374
- [Interviewer On Left] Why
do you think it's a trend now?

00:01:20.374 --> 00:01:21.617
- Even with machine tattooing,

00:01:21.617 --> 00:01:24.639
there is an element of sort of technology

00:01:24.639 --> 00:01:27.283
coming into the body and the artwork.

00:01:27.283 --> 00:01:28.933
And when you take that away,

00:01:28.933 --> 00:01:30.749
you get something that's
a little bit more.

00:01:30.749 --> 00:01:33.018
I don't know, precious? A
little bit more special.

00:01:33.018 --> 00:01:35.199
I mean, you have to be
focused to be able to do it.

00:01:35.199 --> 00:01:37.117
It takes so long, and it's
a little bit grueling.

00:01:37.117 --> 00:01:38.873
So, it's kind of a labor of love.

00:01:38.873 --> 00:01:40.603
I think, there's so much
stuff about your body

00:01:40.603 --> 00:01:42.340
that you don't get to choose.

00:01:42.340 --> 00:01:44.853
Size, shape, color, texture,

00:01:44.853 --> 00:01:49.273
and it feels really good to
be in control of one thing.

00:01:49.273 --> 00:01:50.810
This is my body, I'm
going to make it look like

00:01:50.810 --> 00:01:52.291
what I want it to look like.

00:01:52.291 --> 00:01:54.662
- Well, lets send this directly to my mom.

00:01:54.662 --> 00:01:55.929
I'm ready, are you ready?

00:01:55.929 --> 00:01:56.980
You're going first, I'm not going first.

00:01:56.980 --> 00:01:57.926
- I know.

00:01:57.926 --> 00:02:00.843
(light rock music)

00:02:04.137 --> 00:02:05.939
I can't believe I'm
getting it on my chest.

00:02:05.939 --> 00:02:08.999
(both laugh)

00:02:08.999 --> 00:02:12.425
a little bit, I know it's
going to be really painful.

00:02:12.425 --> 00:02:14.238
- Okay, so what are you
thinking orientation-wise

00:02:14.238 --> 00:02:15.272
with the dots.

00:02:15.272 --> 00:02:16.247
- Dots down.

00:02:16.247 --> 00:02:17.536
- Dots down, like this.

00:02:17.536 --> 00:02:18.369
- Yes.

00:02:18.369 --> 00:02:19.248
- Okay.

00:02:19.248 --> 00:02:22.165
(light rock music)

00:02:25.670 --> 00:02:26.503
- Yes.

00:02:28.045 --> 00:02:30.712
(loud thumping)

00:02:32.370 --> 00:02:33.203
Ooh!

00:02:34.958 --> 00:02:36.125
Yeah, it does.

00:02:41.997 --> 00:02:44.914
(light rock music)

00:02:59.638 --> 00:03:00.471
It's done?

00:03:04.293 --> 00:03:06.376
She did such a great job!

00:03:07.926 --> 00:03:10.703
It stings a little bit still.

00:03:10.703 --> 00:03:13.036
It's like the sun coming up.

00:03:16.662 --> 00:03:19.245
(techno music)

00:03:24.948 --> 00:03:26.865
- I think it's perfect.

00:03:42.171 --> 00:03:43.004
- Yeah.

00:03:59.092 --> 00:04:00.009
- Good Job!

00:04:03.303 --> 00:04:05.136
- [Fellow Interviewer]

00:04:07.128 --> 00:04:09.711
(techno music)

00:04:12.620 --> 00:04:13.960
- So we just got tatted.

00:04:13.960 --> 00:04:14.885
- We survived!

00:04:14.885 --> 00:04:15.718
- We survived.

00:04:15.718 --> 00:04:18.841
So, I'll say, all in all, it really

00:04:18.841 --> 00:04:21.090
wasn't that bad as I anticipated.

00:04:21.090 --> 00:04:23.180
I definitely, maybe I
might've psyched myself out

00:04:23.180 --> 00:04:25.746
a little bit more than was necessary.

00:04:25.746 --> 00:04:26.579
- Same.

00:04:26.579 --> 00:04:30.271
I feel like afterwards,
the pain diminishes a lot.

00:04:30.271 --> 00:04:31.856
- Oh my god, the popping!

00:04:31.856 --> 00:04:32.855
(loud thumping)

00:04:32.855 --> 00:04:33.972
- Ooh!

00:04:33.972 --> 00:04:36.035
- It's puncturing your skin, every time.

00:04:36.035 --> 00:04:37.895
So you could physically hear like the...

00:04:37.895 --> 00:04:40.021
- [Both] Poom, Poom, Poom!

00:04:40.021 --> 00:04:41.414
So gross!

00:04:41.414 --> 00:04:43.236
- I would fuck it up, if
I were a tattoo artist,

00:04:43.236 --> 00:04:44.810
but yes I would do it again.

00:04:44.810 --> 00:04:46.112
- I loved the experience all and all,

00:04:46.112 --> 00:04:47.530
and will definitely do it again.

00:04:47.530 --> 00:04:48.880
- Yep, 10 out of 10.

00:04:48.880 --> 00:04:50.719
- Go get hand-poked, go
get stabbed by somebody.

00:04:50.719 --> 00:04:53.149
- Do it yourself, don't do it yourself.

00:04:53.149 --> 00:04:55.007
- [Both] (laugh)

00:04:55.007 --> 00:04:57.590
(techno music)

